{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_04_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_04","title":"掌櫃","storyCode":"WR-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"438fc49a7409731b30e75cd2637d77dc7ada3cfdca224fdce2734bba4cfb826d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"烏有帶著小女孩一路逃跑，總算成功與克洛絲會合。另一面，嵯峨、黎、炎熔三人暫時躲避在當鋪內。黎似乎知道些什麼。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘呀，你看這天色都亮起來了，咱們也走了挺遠的了，就快到了，別哭了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，有哥哥陪著你，可安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......別哭啦別哭啦，都能看到園子了，馬上就到啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀呀——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼這邊也有！不是說它們怕太陽的嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"來，你......你騎我頭上，抓穩了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔！叔叔你跑快點啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"別，別揪我頭髮！眼鏡要掉了，要掉了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......烏有這傢伙，跑得倒是真挺快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄，您在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，沒什麼，你們快去院子裡躲著，外面的警戒交給我就好啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"那個體型的小墨魎，似乎比尋常的源石蟲要迅速一些......不過好像有點被繞暈了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然真的跑不過烏有哎......？還有這種事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......嘎啊......嘎啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看招！嘿！喝！呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！過不來了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔！你就不能快點跑嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我早就想這麼幹了，那些電影裡的功夫明星，在街上追逐時一定要掀點什麼的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快、快跑！快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別打我腦袋！真把我當馱獸啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"繞過來了！？這都太陽照屁股了，不是說這些玩意怕光的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"救，救命呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！喂，小姑娘，你先走，我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......是克洛絲恩人！哎喲喂，大恩人呐，您要是幫得到，就早點幫我呀，呃，您、您在哪兒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......！姐、姐姐你從哪裡冒出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！不愧是非同凡響的狙擊高手，神出鬼沒，落地無聲，實在是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐！謝謝你救了叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"趕快回家吧，你媽媽找你很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人呐，您要不趕緊去幫幫炎熔和嵯峨二位？這裡讓我守著，保證周全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......你剛才是不是在炎熔那裡信誓旦旦地說會回去幫她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩、恩人，莫非您有那順風耳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"你這把扇子，怎麼一直握在手上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那必須的，這把扇子可是我最鍾愛的物件，乃是我那授業恩師相贈，可捨不得放下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，嘿，手裡捧個扇子，不是顯得我斯文嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"哼嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那隻墨魎，為什麼到了這裡也沒事？這裡算是白天了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想問啊，給那玩意兒追得可累了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......總之，先去找小炎熔吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......變安靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡明明是在黑夜邊緣，只能看見一點點黎明，為什麼沒有怪物衝向這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧也覺得奇怪，從未如此安靜過呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜些，不是好事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！也確是如此，小僧也總算可以喘口氣啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"小心些，別壓壞了貨件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨，剛才你說的夕娥......那是指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"自然是“夕娥奔月”這段佳話中的那位夕娥了，哎呀，小僧至今也忘不掉夕娥那雙眸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨，你慢點說。炎熔小姐的臉色越來越古怪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，抱歉抱歉，是小僧心急了。方才抵禦墨魎，想必炎熔小姐也乏了吧？不如坐下喝杯茶，咱們好好敘敘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我去為兩位泡壺茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，小僧想先問一句，黎姑娘可知道離開這裡的辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕輕搖頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黎抬起頭，看向門外，以及道路的遠方。\n不敢高聲語——\n——恐驚天上人。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["烏有"]}]}
